  "summary_en": "UK statutory instrument amending the Medical Devices Regulations 2002 and 2019 EU Exit Regulations after Brexit. It sets Northern Ireland rules (UK(NI) indication, UK responsible persons, registration) and Great Britain rules (UK marking, approved bodies, acceptance of CE-marked devices). No AI or robotics content.",
